      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "James Sterling demonstrates strong professional character through his proactive nature and directness, making him reliable under pressure. His consistent high performance suggests significant leadership potential driven by his accountability. Claire Whitlock possesses strong interpersonal qualities, serving as a cohesive presence through conflict resolution and mentorship. Her meticulous nature and ability to unify the team indicate strong, supportive leadership potential. Robert Vance displays a highly authoritative and results-oriented character, commanding respect through his technical strength. His strong drive suggests a leadership style focused on high standards and technical excellence.",
