      "content": "thanks. that looks good. here is the second batch. these people are on the same level as the first group, just different team leads. please do the same thing—summary of character and leadership potential for each.\n\nEmployee: Omar Al-Fayed\nFeedback: Omar is extremely focused on the technical aspects of our projects. He is very intense during code reviews and can be quite blunt when he sees errors, which sometimes makes meetings feel tense. He is incredibly hardworking and always puts in the extra hours to ensure the work is done.\n\nEmployee: Priya Sharma\nFeedback: Priya has a very high level of technical competence and is very diligent with her documentation. She is very respectful in her interactions and always follows the established protocols. She is a very steady worker who can be relied upon to get her tasks done correctly.\n\nEmployee: Arjun Mehta\nFeedback: Arjun is very vocal in project planning sessions. He often challenges the status quo and has a very strong opinion on how things should be run. He is very ambitious and is clearly aiming for a management role quickly.",
